  "description": "Do-won, whose memory started from Do-hwa-won a hundred years ago, is given the responsibility of going down to the ground and dealing with the incident by Shinseon Woldeok.  Do Wongyeol, physically bound to each other like fate.  When they can no longer be separated by more than twelve steps, they start living together.  Do-won and Gyeol-i struggle to solve the incidents created by the peach seeds that have spread on the ground.  When coincidences overlap, it is inevitable.  Now, their time stopped by the rain begins to flow again.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%82%AC%EB%9E%8C%EC%9D%B4%EB%9D%BC%ED%98%B8/2814), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60684153) \n\n*Official Translations:*     \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/180772)",
